---
---
<section id="why" class="bg-charcoal px-6 py-28 text-cream md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
    <div class="fade-in-up text-center">
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-light">
        Why This Exists
      </p>
      <h2
        class="mx-auto max-w-3xl font-serif font-normal leading-tight"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
      >
        Modern dating has two bad modes.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in-up mx-auto mt-14 grid max-w-[960px] gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-serif text-2xl text-cream">Endless swiping</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-cream/70" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          Plenty of impressions, very little context, and almost no accountability. Good for keeping you active. Bad for helping you choose well.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-serif text-2xl text-cream">Random social scenes</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-cream/70" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          Fun in theory, chaotic in practice. Too little curation, too much ambiguity, and not much designed for actual chemistry.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in-up mx-auto mt-16 max-w-[960px] rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-8 py-9 text-center">
      <h3
        class="font-serif italic text-cream"
        style="font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
      >
        We’re the middle path.
      </h3>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-[760px] flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        {[
          'Socially functional people',
          'Events built for conversation',
          'Clearer intentions',
          'Thoughtful introductions',
          'Reputation matters',
        ].map((text) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-light text-cream/80">
            {text}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in-up mx-auto mt-16 max-w-[960px] border-t border-white/10 pt-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-base font-light text-cream/60">
        This is not another app.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-lg italic text-gold-light">
        It’s a private social club with stronger context built in.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
